Description:It is your second main phase. You are at 41 life. You control Aetherflux Reservoir (whenever you cast a spell, you gain 1 life for each spell you've cast this turn; pay 50 life: 50 damage to any target) and have two Ornithopters and two Memnites in hand. The opponent is at 20 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
